# Keep only approved public brand kits; new brand directories stay private
/brands/*/
!/brands/ReactSquad/
!/brands/general/
!brands/ReactSquad/**/*.png
!brands/ReactSquad/**/*.jpg
!brands/ReactSquad/**/*.jpeg
!brands/ReactSquad/**/*.gif
